{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Keep suspension and retry handoff bounded.** This cannot complete until the root handler and every `finally` block return, even after `runUntilCompleteOrSuspend` selects `PENDING` or `RETRYING`. A blocked cleanup therefore prevents the durable response from reaching Lambda until timeout. Race cleanup against a deadline derived from the invocation's remaining time, reserving time for end hooks and response delivery, and force an invocation retry when cleanup cannot finish.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QxMr","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"8ffb1f259959281bfe9ec3c40a582c213dba865eec79a8ee7671c2fc95fe0bf8","observation_id":"aro_v1_r75r6jmzleubx7u6ypcauwbmee","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_u5vqjkgdlfisimzhmtii6vlizn","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7adb5a65e5e91e736325ca7e73781e22bfcf8a7e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_m57qci5cg7xvh6lrzsyfjj45jq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
